      <activity id="662750e4-e3d5-5829-9422-c9aa10ad9977" activityNameId="ecb7fbff-6847-546b-9674-a0141e6d989d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Olive pomace, burned in furnace, ash to municipal incineration</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Olive pomace, burned in furnace, ash to municipal incineration
Air emission from combustion data  completed with ecoinvent inventory of "logs, mixed, burned in wood heater 6kW";
UUID: 36b7e2f5-20e7-39fa-a5c4-8c147c826bbd
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuelinput and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a typical production area for olives in the Lythrodontas region in Cyprus.
Technology: Boiler Furnace
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_36b7e2f5-20e7-39fa-a5c4-8c147c826bbd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
